  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About: Unattended executor. HTTP GET NPCI_Queue_url -&gt; parse items (bare array or wrapped object; keys rrn, amount,&#xd;&#xa;status/decision, rail, bcId, accountNo, dossierId) -&gt; keep APPROVED / AUTO_APPROVED / VERIFIED AePS items -&gt; POST&#xd;&#xa;/api/hitl/approve?txn_id=&amp;approver=AE_AEPS_CBS_BOT&amp;notes= (backend posts the reversal to Finacle CBS) -&gt; aggregate credits per BC agent -&gt; POST float&#xd;&#xa;replenishment to the GL-9904 float ledger API -&gt; return execution status (o_http_status 200 on full success).&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Config params: NPCI_Queue_url (default http://localhost:8000/api/hitl/queue), CBS_CREDIT_API_URL, FLOAT_LEDGER_API_URL,&#xd;&#xa;OUTPUT_DIR. Runtime params: none.&#xd;&#xa;Errors: every branch (invalid config, queue unreachable, queue non-2xx, CBS unreachable / rejected, float ledger failure) is&#xd;&#xa;normalised into one event stream so the single result step reports an accurate outcome (Failure / 207 partial / 502).&#xd;&#xa;Excel outputs attached to the result: AePS_CBS_Execution_Audit_&lt;ts&gt;.xlsx, AePS_Float_Ledger_Events_&lt;ts&gt;.xlsx.</note>
